option.WHITE_BALANCE=White Balance
option.WHITE_BALANCE.comment=Scene white point in Kelvin. Lower values look cooler, higher values warmer.
option.SATURATION=Saturation
option.VIBRANCE=Vibrance
option.CONTRAST=Contrast
option.SHADOW_TINT=Split Toning
option.SHADOW_TINT.comment=Cool shadows and warm highlights (dimension-specific tints in the Nether and End).
option.VIGNETTE=Vignette
option.VIGNETTE_STRENGTH=Vignette Strength
